    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Full Page Slider</strong> is a lightweight yet powerful plugin that lets you build stunning full-page scroll-based sliders directly within the WordPress block editor (Gutenberg). It’s perfect for landing pages, portfolios, agency websites, and storytelling sites that require smooth, section-based navigation.</p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>🔲 Create fullscreen sliding sections with ease</li>\n<li>🧱 Gutenberg-native: uses custom blocks, no page builder required</li>\n<li>🎨 Add heading, content, background, and optional footers for each slide</li>\n<li>🧭 Vertical or horizontal slide layouts</li>\n<li>⚡ Smooth animation transitions</li>\n<li>🔤 Google Fonts integration for enhanced typography</li>\n<li>⚙️ Dedicated admin page for settings and management</li>\n<li>🎛️ Enhanced slide-level controls for detailed customization</li>\n<li>🖼️ Works with any theme</li>\n<li>🌐 Responsive and mobile-ready</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re creating a one-page site or an interactive multi-section experience, Full Page Slider helps you deliver it beautifully and fast.</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later. See https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html for more details.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin ZIP file via the <strong>Plugins &gt; Add New &gt; Upload Plugin</strong> section in your WordPress dashboard.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin from the Plugins menu.</li>\n<li>In the Block Editor, search for <strong>Full Page Slider</strong> in the block inserter.</li>\n<li>Add the block to your page and begin creating slide sections.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20this%20with%20any%20theme%3F'>\nCan I use this with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, Full Page Slider works with any modern WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20this%20plugin%20compatible%20with%20page%20builders%20like%20elementor%3F'>\nIs this plugin compatible with page builders like Elementor?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>This plugin is built for the Gutenberg editor. It may not be compatible with other page builders.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20add%20images%2C%20buttons%2C%20or%20videos%20to%20slides%3F'>\nCan I add images, buttons, or videos to slides?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, each slide supports multiple inner blocks, so you can add almost any content Gutenberg supports.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20it%20support%20horizontal%20sliding%3F'>\nDoes it support horizontal sliding?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! You can toggle between vertical and horizontal slide modes.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>New:</strong> Added Google Fonts integration for enhanced typography options</li>\n<li><strong>New:</strong> Added dedicated admin menu page for plugin settings and management</li>\n<li><strong>Enhanced:</strong> Improved slide-level controls for better customization</li>\n<li><strong>Enhanced:</strong> Added support for links and redirection on plugin activation</li>\n<li><strong>Improved:</strong> Hidden content color controls for slider and slide blocks for better UX</li>\n<li><strong>Fixed:</strong> Resolved console errors and various bugs</li>\n<li><strong>Updated:</strong> GitHub Actions workflow improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release of Full Page Slider</li>\n<li>Gutenberg block with slide layout and customization options</li>\n<li>Supports heading, content, background, and custom footers</li>\n<li>Mobile responsive and theme-independent</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Full Page Slider is a Gutenberg-powered plugin that allows you to create immersive, full-page sliders using the WordPress block editor.",
    "description": "<p><strong>Full Page Slider</strong> is a lightweight yet powerful plugin that lets you build stunning full-page scroll-based sliders directly within the WordPress block editor (Gutenberg). It’s perfect for landing pages, portfolios, agency websites, and storytelling sites that require smooth, section-based navigation.</p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>🔲 Create fullscreen sliding sections with ease</li>\n<li>🧱 Gutenberg-native: uses custom blocks, no page builder required</li>\n<li>🎨 Add heading, content, background, and optional footers for each slide</li>\n<li>🧭 Vertical or horizontal slide layouts</li>\n<li>⚡ Smooth animation transitions</li>\n<li>🔤 Google Fonts integration for enhanced typography</li>\n<li>⚙️ Dedicated admin page for settings and management</li>\n<li>🎛️ Enhanced slide-level controls for detailed customization</li>\n<li>🖼️ Works with any theme</li>\n<li>🌐 Responsive and mobile-ready</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re creating a one-page site or an interactive multi-section experience, Full Page Slider helps you deliver it beautifully and fast.</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later. See https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html for more details.</p>\n",
